 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp |  65 ++++++++++++++++++++
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetQsee.cpp        | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 170 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

